WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:05.154
A day passed.

2
00:00:05.155 --> 00:00:09.356
The woodcutters were coming closer.

3
00:00:09.357 --> 00:00:13.113
Beauty tried to help Beast.

4
00:00:13.114 --> 00:00:17.140
He refused to eat or drink.

5
00:00:17.141 --> 00:00:20.263
Still Beauty sat by his side.

6
00:00:20.264 --> 00:00:23.544
Deer and some birds stayed too.

7
00:00:23.545 --> 00:00:28.061
"Please, Beast, get better," Beauty begged.

8
00:00:28.062 --> 00:00:30.990
"Maybe you could try some magic."

9
00:00:30.991 --> 00:00:34.941
But Beast didn't even open his eyes.

10
00:00:34.942 --> 00:00:39.067
Another petal fell from the rose.

11
00:00:39.068 --> 00:00:43.550
Deer gently touched her nose to Beauty's elbow.

12
00:00:43.551 --> 00:00:47.755
Her deep brown eyes were full of sadness.

13
00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:51.549
"I'm sad too," Beauty said.

14
00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:53.543
Deer stood up.

15
00:00:53.544 --> 00:00:57.783
"You want me to follow you?" Beauty asked.

16
00:00:57.784 --> 00:01:01.758
Deer nodded.

17
00:01:01.759 --> 00:01:07.152
She led Beauty through the castle.

18
00:01:07.153 --> 00:01:10.637
Soon they came to a lovely room.

19
00:01:10.638 --> 00:01:14.791
It was warm and cozy.

20
00:01:14.792 --> 00:01:18.568
Deer showed Beauty a painting.

21
00:01:18.569 --> 00:01:22.302
A young boy smiled at his mother.

22
00:01:22.303 --> 00:01:26.208
"He loves her," Beauty said.

23
00:01:26.209 --> 00:01:33.230
"That's how I look at my father."

24
00:01:33.231 --> 00:01:37.737
Deer showed Beauty another painting.

25
00:01:37.738 --> 00:01:40.883
It was a young man and woman.

26
00:01:40.884 --> 00:01:44.223
They held hands and smiled.

27
00:01:44.224 --> 00:01:47.741
"They're in love," Beauty said.

28
00:01:47.742 --> 00:01:50.904
Deer nodded.

29
00:01:50.905 --> 00:01:54.673
Then she showed Beauty one more thing.

30
00:01:54.674 --> 00:01:57.861
Beauty held up a long paper.

31
00:01:57.862 --> 00:02:01.050
It read: Hear ye, hear ye.

32
00:02:01.051 --> 00:02:05.021
The castle mourns our beloved princess.

33
00:02:05.022 --> 00:02:08.709
"Wait." Beauty was confused.

34
00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:11.966
Then she glanced back at the painting.

35
00:02:11.967 --> 00:02:14.979
"The prince lost his princess?"

36
00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:17.314
Deer nodded.

37
00:02:17.315 --> 00:02:22.434
"Poor man. His heart was broken," Beauty said.

38
00:02:22.435 --> 00:02:27.316
"But why are you showing me this, Deer?"

39
00:02:27.317 --> 00:02:31.737
Deer walked out of the room.

40
00:02:31.738 --> 00:02:35.708
Beauty followed her back to Beast's room.

41
00:02:35.709 --> 00:02:40.579
Deer pointed her nose at the painting of the prince.

42
00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:46.478
"Okay," Beauty said. "That's the same prince but . . .

43
00:02:46.479 --> 00:02:49.444
What does that have to do with Beast?"

44
00:02:49.445 --> 00:02:52.127
Beauty looked at Deer.

45
00:02:52.128 --> 00:02:56.320
The animal's eyes filled with tears.

46
00:02:56.321 --> 00:03:01.930
Then she placed a hoof on Beast's hand.

